#: ../../source/guides/formats/advanced/structured.md:23
msgid ""
"The pipeline and the index are almost always omitted and derived. The "
"index in particular is derived from **the other rows of the same "
"`(format, pipeline)` group**, not from the row alone — so rows sharing an"
" id describe one pipe, and consecutive groups get consecutive pipes."
